path-to-regexp 6.3.0

The unmodified package/dist/index.js is stored as path-to-regexp.cjs;
package/LICENSE is stored as path-to-regexp.LICENSE. The package archive URL,
archive SHA-256 and member SHA-256 values are in upstream.lock.json.

Check the vendored members without downloading or running JavaScript:

    python3 -m unittest discover -s tooling/tests -p test_stats_matcher_provenance.py -v

The Development environment workflow runs this check with the tooling test suite.
To update, obtain the archive named by the lock, verify its archive hash, and copy
these two members without newline conversion. Update the lock and review the
configured matcher semantics and engine pin together.
